ized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5521111779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#issuecomment-5521111779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123115","id":5521111779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSRV64w","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T05:44:14Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T05:44:14Z","body":"> As likely the only people who will notice or care about MSDf having a slightly different size are people who will be negatively affected by the change.\r\n\r\nIt still makes sense to fix, since this is definitely a bug, but we should not cherry-pick it to any older versions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5521111779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5522140308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#issuecomment-5522140308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123115","id":5522140308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSSUslA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T07:25:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T07:25:32Z","body":"> Does this also fix #121369?\r\n\r\nIt doesnt, but I have a fix for that one too which I'll send today.\r\n\r\nIMO this is a bug we should fix, but as I suggested we should probably add a compat option to keep the invalid conversion for pre-existing games.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5522140308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5524108965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#issuecomment-5524108965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123115","id":5524108965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSUM2pQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T10:10:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T10:10:56Z","body":"I've added compat code as a separate commit for review. I made it a project setting instead of a per-font import flag, as the latter would add a lot of boilerplate everywhere for something that's only intended for pre-Godot 4.8 projects to toggle.\r\n\r\nCurrently it's disabled by default. We could add logic so that it's enabled automatically when upgrading for 4.7 to 4.8. Or we could assume most users won't mind the fixed metric and only flag it in our migration guide as a behavior compat breakage with a workaround.\r\n\r\nWe can also bikeshed about the name, for now I put it as `gui/theme/compat_msdf_legacy_scaling` but there's also a `gui/fonts/` category, albeit with a single setting in a subsection: `gui/fonts/dynamic_fonts/use_oversampling`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5524108965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5524131166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#issuecomment-5524131166","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123115","id":5524131166,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSUONXg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T10:12:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T10:12:52Z","body":"Since it's a compat setting, should it be in the `#ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED`?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5524131166/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5531856392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123115#issuecomment-5531856392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123115","id